contentText:
Three years after Daniel Nigro created his label imprint Amusement Records specifically to sign Chappell Roan , Billboard can exclusively announce Thursday (May 28) that Interscope Records has partnered with him to add another artist to his roster: Devon Again, an alt-pop tastemaker currently gearing up to open for Olivia Rodrigo on tour.

